OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 15, named as victim of
OL,4,Aelectric motorbike crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a teenager who died from
OL,7,Fhis injuries following a crash between
OL,8,Fan off-road electric motorcycle and a
OL,9,Fcar has described him as the "light of
OL,10,Fmy life".
OL,12,FWest Yorkshire Police said Harley
OL,13,FHartley, 15, was riding the bike on
OL,14,FSchool Street in Bierley, Bradford on 1
OL,15,FOctober about 17:30 BST when he was
OL,16,Finvolved in a collision with a black
OL,17,FAudi S3.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
