OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 15, named as victim of
OL,4,Aelectric motorbike crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was taken to hospital with serious
OL,7,Finjuries, but died on 28 October.
OL,8,FAnyone with information about either
OL,9,Fvehicle prior to or during the crash
OL,10,Fshould get in touch, the force said.
OL,12,FPaying tribute to her son, his mother
OL,13,Fsaid she had been "left numb,
OL,14,Fbroken-hearted, every emotion you could
OL,15,Fever feel".
